  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: c59921a22062079419e0bffed4cfa04b, type: 3}
  m_Name: D-02
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DispatchScenarioData
  scenarioId: D-02
  readyForPlay: 1
  sourceNotes: "Kaynak: afet_senaryolari_kaynak_12.md. Vatanda\u015F s\xF6zleri kaynaktan aynen al\u0131nm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131r."
  opening:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: 912 Acil \xC7a\u011Fr\u0131, sakin olun. Adresinizi ve durumunuzu s\xF6yleyin."
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Alo evlad\u0131m... Mara\u015F merkezdeyiz, \xE7ar\u015F\u0131ya yak\u0131n bir apartmanday\u0131z. B\xFCy\xFCk bir deprem atlatt\u0131k az \xF6nce, bina salland\u0131 durdu ama her an daha b\xFCy\xFC\u011F\xFC gelir diyorlar, ev \xE7atlak dolu!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Beyefendi sakin olun, isminiz nedir? Yaralanan var m\u0131?"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "KAZAZEDE: Emekli \xF6\u011Fretmen Mehmet ben evlad\u0131m. Han\u0131mla ikimiziz. Han\u0131m 'Gel masan\u0131n yan\u0131na \xE7\xF6kelim' diyor ama ben eski k\xF6y evlerinden bilirim! Kap\u0131 kasas\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131na ge\xE7ip dikileyim diyorum, ya da mutfaktaki \xE7elik buzdolab\u0131na sar\u0131lay\u0131m!"
    fromOperator: 0
  - text: "Mehmet: Evlad\u0131m, art\xE7\u0131 gelirse kap\u0131 pervaz\u0131nda duray\u0131m de\u011Fil mi? En sa\u011Flam yer oras\u0131d\u0131r!"
    fromOperator: 0
  choiceA: "Evet Mehmet Amca, kap\u0131 kasas\u0131nda durmak g\xF6vdeyi korur, kap\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131na ge\xE7in!"
  choiceB: "Hay\u0131r! Kap\u0131 pervazlar\u0131 modern binalarda ta\u015F\u0131y\u0131c\u0131 de\u011Fildir, buzdolab\u0131 da devrilir! Sa\u011Flam bir koltu\u011Fun yan\u0131na \xE7\xF6k\xFCn!"
  correctChoiceIsB: 1
  resourceA: 2
  resourceB: 2
  dispatchA: 1
  dispatchB: 1
  outcomeA:
  - text: "Mehmet: Hah! Ben biliyordum... Kap\u0131n\u0131n kasas\u0131na ge\xE7tim, tutunuy-- AHHH! Art\xE7\u0131 vurdu, kap\u0131dan k\u0131r\u0131lacak gibi sesler geliyor! Ne yapmal\u0131y\u0131-..."
    fromOperator: 0
  outcomeB:
  - text: "Operat\xF6r: Mehmet Amca sak\u0131n! Kap\u0131 h\u0131zla \xE7arp\u0131p seni ezer, \xFCst lentolar \xE7\xF6ker. Hemen salondaki al\xE7ak ve a\u011F\u0131r koltu\u011Fun yan\u0131na ge\xE7, dizlerini \xE7ekip ba\u015F\u0131n\u0131 koru!"
    fromOperator: 1
  - text: "Mehmet: Tamam evlad\u0131m, koltu\u011Fun yan\u0131na minderi \xE7ekip \xE7\xF6kt\xFCk... Bak art\xE7\u0131 sallad\u0131 yine hafiften... Koltuk korudu bizi, s\u0131valar kap\u0131n\u0131n oraya d\xF6k\xFCld\xFC hep. Sa\u011F olas\u0131n evlat."
    fromOperator: 0
